stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Loading: open
  Loading --> Ready: valid response
  Loading --> Refused: invalid response or refusal
  Refused --> Loading: refresh retry
  Ready --> Ready: select all/current/historical or condition
  Ready --> EmptySubset: select without matching evidence
  EmptySubset --> Ready: select matching evidence
  Ready --> Loading: refresh or server filters (retain selection)
  EmptySubset --> Loading: refresh (retain selection)
  Loading --> Loading: newer request supersedes old
  Ready --> Ready: stale completion ignored after newer success
  Ready --> Idle: clear resets selection
  Loading --> Idle: clear or authorization failure
  Idle --> Idle: retired completion ignored
  Ready --> Disposed: dispose
  Loading --> Disposed: dispose
  Disposed --> Disposed: retired completion ignored
  note right of Ready
    Area condition and membership are server-owned.
    Evidence status uses only parsed current.
    No writes, locks or downloads are introduced.
  end note
